      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present this beautifully maintained and wonderfully presented two-bedroom, first-floor apartment to the open market. Ideally positioned in the very heart of Glasnevin, this attractive home offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with ample free on-street parking available in the surrounding area. The property retains many of its original features and is presented in true turnkey condition throughout, offering an excellent opportunity for a tenant to move into a warm & comfortable home that is available immediately.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious entrance hall, with two generously proportioned double bedrooms to the right-hand side offering large windows positioned overlooking Fitzmaurice Road below. There is also a spacious family bathroom and a bright and inviting kitchen/breakfast room with plenty of added storage, providing an excellent space for both everyday dining and relaxation. The property is thoughtfully maintained throughout and offers bright colours for comfortable living in a highly convenient and established residential location.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property's best assets. Located on the first floor above SPAR, it is close to all local amenities, with a pharmacy, butchers, restaurants and a post office all within a 2-minute walk of your front door, with Glasnevin village being only a short stroll away too. Glasnevin is a vibrant and well-established neighbourhood known for its rich history and convenient proximity to Dublin city centre and a short drive to Dublin Airport. Residents benefit from an excellent range of local amenities including shops, cafes, and public transport links, with nearby bus routes and Drumcondra train station providing easy city access. Sports enthusiasts will appreciate the close proximity to Na Fianna GAA, Tolka Rovers, Croke Park, and other local clubs. There are several excellent schools nearby, including a short distance to Ireland's fastest growing university, DCU. It is also close to some of the best schools on Dublin's northside, including Educate Together Glasnevin, Scoil Mobhi, St. Aidan's CBS and Mount Temple. Dublin Airport is a 10-minute drive away, while the M50 sits just 2km north of the area. For outdoor recreation, Albert College Park and the National Botanic Gardens are within walking distance, offering scenic walking trails and green open spaces.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer, and is strictly by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690."
